<description>&lt;p&gt;Myanmar’s military has announced it will not comply with parts of the International Court of Justice genocide ruling, while the government of Malaysia is repatriating another 6,803 Myanmar nationals despite the ruling. The U.K. has imposed sanctions on five senior Myanmar military officials. The conflict continued to cause 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c61wr87wyg5wo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5kLUNIVUFuVVBYTEVpYUJZQUoyR3RWcmMwbGVxY2FvazhmZzBIT25pWXl0eUpRLXIwWVpGVklxWnprU1Z1OUE2ZnA1dFhSMVFRY2RvRHVMUkNTU3Zv?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPNmpLZUx2TF81aXIxRTRRekpQNGZ2cGNTMDFpdkVfa2Nad3RwZU1kcUtOOWk1SVVDXy1Sbm1PUVl0Rlg5Z0xHREJ6ZFJ6aU9LMTJoSi1heUVGZC1QLTJKZm12d24xbEZQRE16NGdPOEdSdzU3LXhnSUQ3blRJX3JGMTVXU0xINXNmTjhCMWxCY1pkT1cxYkc2UFhrV2EwbENlamRlSGdVbEdqWnE0YjBVbGR3U09kQUx5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNejJfVmF4cldMSmxMajNlcGFVcWc3Tmp0NHlfUWEzQmtTRkhGOG94YmhycnMwODFXaGZ0R0IwX3JoeWNiSi1UaHFHYnZXenM1T0gtWEV3UlRGVWRiVHM2Qkc0TjBEWjZHbktsSk8wWk8xbGFxMVdUNjZwU3QtcVNwaV96c2FVN3lza3pWQ1VjWEpYY1lTZ0FIUDRfOENfX3RBMkxRZkl5VVN5eEZmbXNkREhvYmhKWktmZFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNM0Fta1BkcGNCQ3ZRMmRYZ055QmhtMjNuQW83d0hUbWJEOGo3SmloTmdENnZmdFQwS0ptVlRFWGFocS1BNGhSNm1xMGdPdEpSVnA1Z0FjY0YwTkVObnctcS01WXRleXlxZUJNRk1zYU9YNlZRcFZJNm1OcklnczhRbzBfc1ROeFJDSmxhMm9LOUNBeEtEd3p2NVlfamo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss